      "description": "Ten random workloads (seed 862) of nine PromQL queries each (sums, quantiles, top-k sums, top-k increases and top-k rates at several groupings) over a synthetic hierarchy of 4 regions × 5 services × 10 jobs × 50 label_0 values: 10,000 series per metric, sampled every 100 ms, lookbacks of 1 to 20 minutes.",
